that you'd offer your lord.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:49.690
My liege!

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.490
I'm a lord now?

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:54.200
Your dad's pretty awesome!

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:58.200
I can't believe he caught
that giant tuna fly fishing!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.750
I guess your dad's pretty amazing, Koi.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:05.460
You only say that because you
don't have to deal with him every day.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.250
But...

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.050
Even then...

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:14.590
I guess I am pretty proud of my dad.

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:19.430
Hiyori! I want to try
catching a tuna, too!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:20.600
Huh?

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:25.400
