00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:59.890
If you leave those mats, you drown.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:00.930
Drown?!

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:03.640
The runts weigh about 20 kilograms,

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:07.060
which is about the same
as the tuna my dad caught.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:08.110
Which means...

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:13.530
If you can't reel in the runts,
you have no chance of catching any tuna.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:19.370
They roam around freely in the water,

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:22.620
so they're gonna feel even
heavier than 20 kilograms.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:27.290
Some people even go to the gym
just so they can catch tuna.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:30.800
So you're telling me
I need to get stacked.

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:34.260
No, that's not all.

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:36.970
You also need stacks.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.850
Let's not go there.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.930
Was that a pun?

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:45.310
My dad had to pay 15,000 yen just
to ride on the boat to catch that tuna.

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:46.600
Fifteen what?!

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:51.860
It's pretty impossible to catch tuna
anyway, so let's just catch what we can.

00:17:51.860 --> 00:17:54.650
