00:20:05.740 --> 00:20:09.370
Hello, I'm Aiko!

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:13.000
H-Hello. I'm Hiyori--

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.000
That's such a cute uniform!

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.630
Oh, thank you...

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:20.470
